Level1 Fixed Color Fill =
SWITCH (
    MAX ( 'MappedParameter'[Category] ),
    "PLACEHOLDER_VALUE_1", "#01B8AA",
    "PLACEHOLDER_VALUE_2", "#FD625E",
    "PLACEHOLDER_VALUE_3", "#F2C80F",
    BLANK ()
)
// Same pattern as circle packing's levelfixedcolorfill.dax -- see that
// file for the full writeup on MAX vs SELECTEDVALUE, composite-key
// constraint, and per-level measure naming.
//
// One of THREE near-identical measures this visual needs -- copy this
// same SWITCH shape for Level 2 and Level 3, swapping the field parameter
// reference and giving each its OWN unique measure name:
//   Level2 Fixed Color Fill = SWITCH ( MAX ( 'MappedParameterTwo'[Category2] ), ... )
//   Level3 Fixed Color Fill = SWITCH ( MAX ( 'MappedParameterThree'[Category3] ), ... )
//
// Bind to Level1ColorOverrideFill. Falls back to level1DefaultFillColor
// when unbound or BLANK().
